cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "IESA-Opt.jl"
message: >-
  If you use IESA-Opt.jl in academic or policy work, please cite both core
  IESA-Opt model papers listed in this file.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "TNO IESA team"
repository-code: "https://github.com/IESA-Opt/IESA-Opt.jl"
abstract: >-
  IESA-Opt.jl is the Julia implementation of the IESA-Opt integrated
  energy-system optimization model for capacity-expansion and dispatch studies
  with sector coupling, temporal detail, storage, flexibility, emissions, and
  scenario comparison.
keywords:
  - energy system optimization
  - integrated energy systems
  - capacity expansion
  - dispatch optimization
  - sector coupling
  - Julia
  - JuMP
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-06-12"
references:
  - type: article
    title: "Modelling of decarbonisation transition in national integrated energy system with hourly resolution"
